He has admitted that the Phodi Durasti as Sy.No.5/3 and 5/4 has been challenged by the Rajarajeshwari Housing Co-Operative Society i.e., defendant No.17 before the DDLR; DDLR canceled the order of ADLR;
when Revision Petition was pending before Deputy Commissioner, they filed an application for conversion of 37 guntas of land for non- agricultural purpose; the Deputy Commissioner passed an order for conversion of 37 guntas in Sy.No.5/1; it was challenged by the defendants by filing Writ petition before the Hon'ble High Court of Karnataka; the Hon'ble High Court of Karnataka disposed of the Writ petition holding that original suits are pending in respect of the matter; there is no evidence on what basis Sy.No.5/1 has been phoded as Sy.No.5/3 and 5/4.
19. Dw-1 is the defendant No.1.
